ogs.bing.com/search/2026/10/your-content-your-choice-clearer-preferences-for-training-and-grounding/"},{"vendor":"Google","status":"planned","status_zh":"计划 2027 年初支持；用它拒绝训练且未显式写 Google-Extended 时，视同禁止 Google-Extended","date":"2027 年初","source_url":"https://developers.google.com/search/blog/2026/10/ai-training-control","source_url_2":"https://developers.google.com/crawling/docs/crawlers-fetchers/google-common-crawlers"}],"spec":{"url":"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-kelley-aipref-training-preference-signal/","status_zh":"IETF 个人草案（individual Internet-Draft），未经 IETF 认可、无正式标准地位","published":"2026-10-30","expires":"2027-05-03"}},"findings":[{"id":"search_blocked_perplexitybot","sev":"warn","block":"access","title":"PerplexityBot（Perplexity 搜索）被禁止","detail":"网站不会在 Perplexity 搜索结果中被展示和链接。","fix":"如果你希望出现在该搜索 / AI 答案中，改为：\nUser-agent: PerplexityBot\nAllow: /","lines":[15,17,19,21,23,25,27,29,31,33,35,37,39,41,43,45],"refs":["https://docs.perplexity.ai/guides/bots"]},{"id":"search_blocked_bytespider","sev":"warn","block":"access","title":"Bytespider（ByteDance 搜索）被禁止","detail":"会影响头条搜索收录；是否能阻止 AI 训练用途，官方没有说明。","fix":"如果你希望出现在该搜索 / AI 答案中，改为：\nUser-agent: Bytespider\nAllow: /","lines":[15,17,19,21,23,25,27,29,31,33,35,37,39,41,43,45],"refs":["https://zhanzhang.toutiao.com/docs/intro/26899"]},{"id":"search_blocked_duckassistbot","sev":"warn","block":"access","title":"DuckAssistBot（DuckDuckGo 搜索）被禁止","detail":"不再作为 DuckDuckGo AI 辅助答案的来源；不影响自然搜索排名。","fix":"如果你希望出现在该搜索 / AI 答案中，改为：\nUser-agent: DuckAssistBot\nAllow: /","lines":[15,17,19,21,23,25,27,29,31,33,35,37,39,41,43,45],"refs":["https://duckduckgo.com/duckduckgo-help-pages/results/duckassistbot"]},{"id":"user_ignores","sev":"info","block":"access","title":"ChatGPT-User、Perplexity-User、meta-externalfetcher、Kimi-User 被限制，但它们可能不遵守 robots.txt","detail":"ChatGPT-User：官方说明 robots.txt 对用户触发请求可能不生效；它也不决定能否出现在 ChatGPT 搜索中。\nPerplexity-User：官方说明它一般忽略 robots.txt，写禁止规则大概率拦不住，需要 WAF 层处理。\nmeta-externalfetcher：官方说明它可能绕过 robots.t